<title>ARGENTINA: Banco Galicia buys control of Sudecor.</title>
<headline>Banco Galicia buys control of Sudecor.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Banco Galicia said Monday it has bought 325,000 ordinary shares in Banco Sudecor for $30 million.</p>
<p>The purchase gives Banco Galicia almost 100 percent of Banco Sudecor stock, Galicia said in a letter to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Jorge Otaola, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0651))</p>
